5
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,700
Episode 02 (E80)

6
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,120
It's still not enough.

7
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,520
Go fetch some more.

8
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,520
The grand formation is on the verge of activation.

9
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,520
We cannot delay this any further.

10
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,120
Senior Brother, you must not!

11
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:47,120
So this is the prestigious and righteous... Burning Incense Valley.

12
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,720
You Evil Sect scum!

13
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,720
How dare you trespass into Burning Incense Valley's forbidden grounds!

14
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,320
Refining a formation with human blood...

15
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,720
For Burning Incense Valley to commit such acts,

16
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,120
how is it any different from the Evil Sect?

17
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,120
Since they discovered our sect's deepest secrets...

18
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,920
...they were destined to die anyway.

19
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,920
We might as well put them to good use.

20
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:08,120
Letting their meager flesh fulfill our sect's grand ambition.

21
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,920
If you cannot bear it...

22
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,120
Then why not offer your own blood...

23
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,520
...to refine this peerless, wondrous formation!

24
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:40,120
TN: Jade Yang Realm (玉阳境) is a high-tier cultivation milestone in Burning Incense Valley's supreme manual, the Burning Incense Jade Tome. The other two tires are Shao Yang Realm (少阳境) – Lesser Yang Realm and Zhi Yang Realm (至阳境) – Extreme Yang Realm (The intermediate tier)

25
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,720
I have long reached the Jade Yang Realm!

26
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,120
This brat only has a few decades of cultivation!

27
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,720
How could I possibly be losing to him?!

28
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:48,120
Since you are so desperate to activate this formation...

29
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,120
متوقفش کن!

30
00:03:58,030 --> 00:04:00,320
Your century-long grand ambition...

31
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,320
...ends right here.

32
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:11,700
What is happening there!?

33
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:12,800
The...

34
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,320
The Inferno Altar!

35
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:16,720
برادر ارشد!

36
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,110
عموی رزمی!

37
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:18,110
What happened here?

38
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,320
Stop asking!

39
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:22,110
Quickly, send men to put out the fire at the back mountain!

40
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:23,300
Let's go!

41
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,110
عموی رزمی،

42
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,320
Master's injuries...

43
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,320
Keep quiet about this!

44
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,720
What just transpired here...

45
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,110
...must never be leaked to anyone! Not a single word!

46
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:32,400
I...

47
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,520
Junior Sister Lu?

48
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,110
Why are you here?

49
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,920
This time around...

50
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:01,520
You've truly gone through a lot of trouble, Young Master.

51
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,720
Your escape techniques, Miss...

52
00:05:04,110 --> 00:05:05,320
...seem to have improved once again.

53
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,920
Even with just your strength alone, Young Master,

54
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:10,720
dealing with them would have been a breeze.

55
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,120
Why did you follow me here?

56
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,520
The Subdue Devil Cave, where the Beast Deity is sealed...

57
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,120
I just so happen to know the way there.

58
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,320
What's wrong?

59
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,920
Didn't expect the treacherous lands of the Southern Border...

60
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,720
...to be this vast, did you?

61
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,720
Legends say that the Ten Thousand Great Mountains...

62
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,320
...hide countless ferocious demon beasts.

63
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,120
And violent, toxic miasma...

64
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,720
Do you see that black mountain peak?

65
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:39,920
At the foot of that mountain...

66
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,120
...lies the Subdue Devil Cave.

67
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,320
This TaoTie of yours...

68
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,520
...seems to have never really liked me.

69
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,520
You don't need to mind it.

70
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,520
It has never trusted humans.

71
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:11,520
Oh?

72
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,720
So it has already...

73
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,520
...started treating me as a human?

74
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,520
You cultivated for a millennium...

75
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,320
...wasn't it precisely to become human?

76
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,120
Hearing me say this,

77
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,120
you should be happy.

78
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,000
آدم...؟

79
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:26,920
What is so good about being human?

80
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,920
A lifetime...

81
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:30,720
...at its longest, is but a fleeting hundred years.

82
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,320
And they are endlessly chasing after...

83
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,920
...illusory and ephemeral things like fame and wealth.

84
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,320
But who could ever know...

85
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,320
...that I once even dreamed...

86
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,120
...of becoming a human.

87
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,520
You were born from the vicious energy of heaven and earth.

88
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,520
You are utterly unique in this world...

89
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,520
...an immortal and indestructible entity.

90
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,320
If you wished it,

91
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,920
you could live as long as the heavens and the earth,

92
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:55,120
and watch the myriad changes of the mortal world unfold.

93
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:59,120
Yet you envy a mere mortal who lives in the morning and dies at dusk.

94
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,320
چی؟

95
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,720
Did that old man DaoXuan from Qing Yun Sect...

96
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,720
...knock the sense out of your head?

97
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,520
That I could come into this world...

98
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,720
...possessing consciousness and sapience...

99
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,320
...is entirely the doing of a human.

100
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:13,920
چی گفتی？

101
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,520
There's a woman.

102
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,520
Yeah, a woman...who used...

103
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,520
...secret shamanic arts to gather...

104
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,320
...the world's vicious energies and extracted them to form me.

105
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,520
When I came into this world...

106
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,320
...the very first sight I saw...

107
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:32,120
...was her.

108
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,120
She was my entire world.

109
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,520
So beautiful...

110
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,320
...so dazzling.

111
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,920
But my appearance back then...

112
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,120
...was truly terrifying.

113
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,720
I grew day by day...

114
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,320
...my power becoming stronger and stronger.

115
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,320
Until that day...

116
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,720
...when my power could finally rival hers...

117
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,520
...everything changed.

118
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,320
She never smiled at me again.

119
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,120
Who is she?

120
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,320
لینگ‌لونگ.

121
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:21,120
The Shaman Goddess of the ancient shaman tribe, Linglong.

122
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:24,120
چرا این کار رو کرد؟

123
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,120
This question...

124
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,120
...I had asked her many times...

125
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,320
...but she was never willing to answer.

126
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,520
It was only later that I understood.

127
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:36,310
What she sought after all along...

128
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,120
...was simply immortality.

129
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,720
جاودانگی؟

130
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,920
You find it ridiculous too, don't you?

131
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,920
What exactly is wrong with you?

132
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,520
You would never have said such things in the past.

133
00:08:53,310 --> 00:08:54,520
Have you ever seen a dying person...

134
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,720
...act the same as usual?

135
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:58,920
But you are not human.

136
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:02,020
پس،

137
00:09:03,310 --> 00:09:05,520
What exactly does it mean to be human?

138
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:08,310
A person I know...

139
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,920
...has faced a life full of bumpy encounters,

140
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,520
...yet he still chooses to bear all his shackles.

141
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,520
No matter what pain or torment he endures...

142
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,520
...he has never given up.

143
00:09:20,310 --> 00:09:22,310
Giving his all for the one he cherishes...

144
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,310
...without ever looking back.

145
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,120
Perhaps...

146
00:09:28,310 --> 00:09:29,310
...what it means to be human...

147
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:32,310
...lies precisely in that unyielding persistence...

148
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,920
...to pursue what one knows is impossible.

149
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,310
آیا واقعاً؟

150
00:09:39,310 --> 00:09:41,120
Since I have now gotten my wish...

151
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,720
...then let me be obstinate just this once.

152
00:09:45,310 --> 00:09:46,310
What have you done to yourself?

153
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:52,720
What is going on?

154
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,520
You actually...

155
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,310
I can't walk anymore, I can't walk!

156
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,310
You two are young...

157
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:16,120
...and you don't even care whether this old man lives or dies!

158
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,320
Then let's rest for a moment.

159
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:18,720
دائوئیست سگ وحشی،

160
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,120
there are no outsiders here now.

161
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,520
You can take the cloth off your face.

162
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:22,920
Having it wrapped up all day...

163
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,320
...it must be terribly uncomfortable.

164
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,520
I'm fine.

165
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:30,320
You've been busy all day helping the refugees on the road...

166
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,520
...you must be the one who's exhausted.

167
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:34,050
Oh,

168
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,120
She's busy alright!

169
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,520
She's so merciful!

170
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:38,520
Giving all our dry rations to others...

171
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,520
...leaving me to starve along with her!

172
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,120
پدربزرگ...

173
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,720
...we're still doing okay.

174
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,920
But if those people didn't get something to eat...

175
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,920
...I'm afraid they really would have starved to death.

176
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,720
Aren't you afraid your grandpa will starve to death?!

177
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,920
You two rest here for a bit.

178
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,520
I'll go see if I can catch a wild beast to satisfy our hunger.

179
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,120
Then we'll have to trouble you, Daoist.

180
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,720
You two just wait for me right here.

181
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,320
And whatever you do, don't wander off!

182
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,120
Hey, look!

183
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,120
Look what I caught!

184
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,920
They left...

185
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:21,040
No.

186
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,920
No, they wouldn't.

187
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,520
یه شیطان‌جانور!

188
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,320
شیائو هوان!

189
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:49,920
Grandpa, watch out!

190
00:11:58,720 --> 00:11:59,520
دائوئیست سگ وحشی!

191
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,320
دائوئیست!

192
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,120
Lady Xiao Huan...

193
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,920
دیگه نزدیک نشو!

194
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:46,720
شیائو هوان!

195
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:56,720
حالت چطوره؟

196
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,520
Did it scare you?

197
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,320
خوبی؟!

198
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,720
حرفی بزن!

199
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:02,520
دا...

200
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,520
دائوئیست سگ وحشی!

201
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:17,520
دائوئیست!

202
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:37,920
بد شد!

203
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:39,520
پنج روح در حال حرکت!

204
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:51,120
پدربزرگ!

205
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:04,120
Why did it fail at such a critical moment?!

206
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,920
Don't tell me the talisman paper expired?!

207
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:08,720
We're doomed... we are completely doomed!

208
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:12,300
پدربزرگ!

209
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,120
دائوئیست!

210
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,520
I'll take this beast down with me!

211
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:52,920
To the death!

212
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,720
Let go of the Daoist!

213
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,320
Quickly, help!

214
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:06,920
کافیه.

215
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,120
The demon beast is dead.

216
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,320
Quickly, save him!

217
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,320
The Daoist... he...

218
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:21,720
What happened to him?

219
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,520
The Daoist...

220
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,720
He's stopped breathing.

221
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:37,120
دائوئیست!

222
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:44,920
The dead cannot be brought back to life.

223
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,720
We should give him...

224
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,320
...a proper burial.

225
00:15:57,520 --> 00:15:58,320
I am going to save him.

226
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:13,490
Listen to the ancient chimes across the Seven Peaks

227
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:20,660
Above the clear jade pool's rainbow bridge, the wind quiets the sea of bamboo

228
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:24,700
Walking beneath the gazing moon

229
00:16:26,470 --> 00:16:31,720
Watching clouds drift and gather in the azure sky

230
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:39,400
Through millennia, how many times has the mortal realm changed?

231
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:45,700
Wild grass overgrows ruined temples and forgotten villages

232
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:53,700
Though stained by the world's ink, my true soul remains pure

233
00:16:54,950 --> 00:17:00,600
How to see through the illusion? To shatter these heavy shackles

234
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:03,700
To sever the threads of karma

235
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:09,080
Can true liberation ever be found?

236
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:15,280
I refuse to hide, for I am one with this mortal dust

237
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:16,900
So stand beside me

238
00:17:17,450 --> 00:17:23,720
Shatter the veil of illusion, behold the towering green mountains

239
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:27,040
Where the sky is boundless and the sea is vast

240
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:33,630
How to see through it all? These heavy shackles

241
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:37,240
To settle the debts of karma

242
00:17:37,250 --> 00:17:43,800
I refuse to hide, for I am one with this mortal dust

243
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:46,700
So stand beside me

244
00:17:47,050 --> 00:17:54,440
Break through the sea of clouds, behold the towering green mountains

245
00:17:54,450 --> 00:18:00,240
Where the sky is boundless and the sea is vast
